  "summary_en": "The White House's July 2025 AI Action Plan sets three pillars: accelerating AI innovation, building AI infrastructure, and leading in international AI diplomacy and security. It prioritises deregulation, open-source AI, workforce, DoD adoption, export controls and biosecurity to secure US AI dominance. Embodied AI appears only briefly, in manufacturing and robotics.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Remove federal regulatory barriers and onerous regulation to accelerate AI innovation",
   "Build AI data centers, energy and semiconductor infrastructure through streamlined permitting",
   "Export the American AI stack to allies and strengthen compute export controls",
   "Accelerate AI adoption across federal agencies and the Department of Defense",
   "Support next-generation manufacturing, including robotics, and strengthen biosecurity screening"
